# End-to-End Investigation Workflow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Analyst
    participant JOCKY as JOCKY CLI/API
    participant Parser as pest Parser
    participant TypeCheck as Type Checker
    participant Compiler as IR Compiler
    participant Policy as Policy Engine
    participant Runtime as Runtime Engine
    participant Collectors as Collectors (Win/Lin)
    participant Evidence as Evidence Store
    participant Correlation as Correlation Engine
    participant Graph as Investigation Graph
    participant Verify as Verification Engine
    participant Export as Export Engine
    participant Dashboard as Frontend Dashboard

    Analyst->>JOCKY: Submit JOCKY Script
    JOCKY->>Parser: Parse Script
    Parser-->>JOKY: AST
    JOKY->>TypeCheck: Type Check + Capability Inference
    TypeCheck-->>JOKY: Typed AST
    JOKY->>Compiler: Lower to IR
    Compiler-->>JOKY: Forensic IR Module
    JOKY->>Policy: Build Execution Contract
    Policy->>Policy: Validate Capabilities\nCheck Allowlist\nEnforce Bounds
    alt Validation Failed
        Policy-->>Analyst: PolicyError
    else Validation Passed
        Policy->>Runtime: Validated Execution Contract
        Runtime->>Runtime: Plan Execution (Topo Sort + Parallelism)
        loop For Each Step
            Runtime->>Collectors: execute(action, params, context)
            Collectors->>Collectors: Collect Evidence\nHash (blake3)\nSign Receipt (Ed25519)
            Collectors-->>Runtime: Evidence + Receipt
            Runtime->>Evidence: Persist Evidence + Receipt\nCreate Provenance Record
        end
        Runtime->>Correlation: All Evidence for Run
        Correlation->>Correlation: Apply Deterministic Rules\nGenerate Correlation Edges
        Correlation->>Graph: Build Investigation Graph\n(Nodes=Evidence, Edges=Correlations)
        Graph->>Graph: Apply Hypothesis Bindings\nCompute Hypothesis Confidence
        Runtime->>Verify: Verify Receipts + Provenance Chain
        Verify->>Verify: Check Signatures\nValidate Hash Chain\nDetect Tamper
        alt Verification Failed
            Verify-->>Analyst: VerificationReport (FAIL + details)
        else Verification Passed
            Verify->>Export: Verified Graph
            Export->>Export: Generate Outputs\nCASE/UCO, Cytoscape, Timesketch, Markdown
            Export-->>Analyst: Investigation Artifacts
            Graph-->>Dashboard: Real-time Updates (WebSocket)
            Dashboard-->>Analyst: Interactive Graph, Timeline, Evidence, Findings
        end
    end
```

